/Pg 23 0 R
/K [0]
>>
endobj
244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In the scenario of the advertisement banner, the state defines user behavior, and we respond by displaying the banner based on the state \(user behavior\) that yields the highest reward \(ad clicks\). Contextual bandits are commonly employed to tailor content to user behavior and address the cold-start challenges encountered by recommendation systems. Netflix utilizes contextual bandits to customize artwork for TV shows based on user behavior.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
